# Job data is created per-project by the `job` tool (jobs/) and by the interactive mode
# (equipo/); it is local state, never part of the template. In a real project you may choose
# to version it: delete these lines (transcripts can be large).
jobs/*
!jobs/.gitkeep
equipo/*
!equipo/.gitkeep

# Filled-in objective: belongs to each concrete project, not to the template
# (delete this line in your project if you want to version it).
OBJECTIVE.md

# Python / OS cruft
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Local environment logs
*.log

# Local, uncommitted policy override next to the tool (the project policy is .agent-team/policy.json)
agent-team/policy.json
